    Corporate pickup is what happens when a normal doorstep pickup isn't enough — when the batch is large, the paperwork matters, and the compliance framework has requirements the pickup team needs to satisfy. This page covers the corporate pickup workflow, how it fits between routine office pickup and full ITAD, and what documentation is standard.
